# Line-ending policy.
#
# Every text file is stored LF-normalised in the repository, whatever the
# checkout OS or the git client's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, staging
# from a client that has autocrlf disabled (WSL, a Linux VM, CI) rewrites the
# whole tree CRLF and every file shows as modified.
* text=auto

# Must stay LF even in a Windows working tree -- these run inside Linux images.
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
Makefile    text eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
